Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,one wish If you want it,\Ngotta go over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing, no time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, they\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.74,0:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.02,0:01:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.88,0:01:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.14,0:01:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Marked maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.24,0:01:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead to new horizons.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.22,0:01:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,In view shining brightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.04,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, who knows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.22,0:01:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.06,0:01:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.26,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:01:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.96,0:02:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Century!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.06,0:02:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You fight and leave Otako to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.60,0:02:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Usuhachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.90,0:02:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck with that dinosaur, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wrap this up quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Two-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Tower Prime return!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Try some Diablo Jolet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,CONCETE!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.86,0:03:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.56,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to say it, but that guy might\Nbe an even match for the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit while you're ahead, Ronin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like fortune favors me today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.14,0:03:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can\Nhandle the Oniwa Banshu too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as Hawkins reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,All of the Straw Hats have somehow\Nwormed their way into the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.38,0:04:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All we need is one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.40,0:04:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your capture and subsequent\Ntorture will reveal your purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.72,0:04:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Capture them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That's some kind of magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninpo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.64,0:04:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Help Biwa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You cheater! It's just a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.70,0:04:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.92,0:04:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, fair maiden!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.16,0:04:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You need only flee the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave these ruffians to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.62,0:04:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach them the true\Nmeaning of rock and roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm the Soul King! Baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I call this one Akashatokuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She was speaking with Zoro Judo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Before she took off running, Fujin\Nrajin—see where that woman is heading?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.84,0:05:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.96,0:05:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,make your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,appearance soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Trafalgar Law,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you came to save us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, captain, we screwed up\Nthe plan for everyone, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:06:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed that our polar\Nbears and with them with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,your ability you could get\Nthem out in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.82,0:06:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of fool would keep all\Ntheir valuable hostages in one place,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,let alone such a conspicuous one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather, you're about to\Nbecome a hostage yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.84,0:06:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you learn anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.82,0:06:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time—did you learn anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,lay a finger on me, not anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,not anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.24,0:06:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to win, there are\Nfour lives you must extinguish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The fourth life would\Nbe my own, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.70,0:07:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But the other three before\Nme are your own crewmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.68,0:07:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Try some Diablo shelter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,On the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I would expect nothing less of a Vinsmoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't hear me the last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever speak that name to me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That was you in the Silver\NMouse costume, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never tell why the hell\Nam I so popular with dino men
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep at this and I'll cut\Nyour tail off and grill it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a lot tougher than page one
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more fun to improve\Nthe flavor of crappy meat
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.92,0:08:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a beautiful woman,\Nand she needs my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Diablo-jamba!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra hot cheese hash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.18,0:09:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.90,0:09:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep a lady waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Never fear, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're protecting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be hiding\Nso you won't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I must have drawn\Nattention when I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mosshead knows that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That beautiful woman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bounty isn't even as high\Nas mine, you arrogant bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to learn your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.84,0:11:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I choose not to join you and\Nyou decide to destroy my life?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.40,0:11:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Ashura!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.74,0:11:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't want that at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My intention was to turn our\Nenemy into yours as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I created a conflict, hoping it would\Nmotivate you to change your ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.14,0:11:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, I harmed you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.26,0:11:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have come to you on\Nhands and knees as I am now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.60,0:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of engaging in deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Spurred by the urgency of our battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I justified my actions by\Ninvoking the name of Lord Odin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.96,0:11:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but I was mistaken from the very start.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it was but a moment to me, I failed\Nto understand the weight of 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.16,0:11:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The minds of this country's\Npeople have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.88,0:12:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a truth that I failed to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that I selfishly refused to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.06,0:12:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet there were many\Nhearts that did not change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.52,0:12:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Unshakable beliefs that weathered\Nthe cruel passage of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.24,0:12:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Yasui revealed this\Ntruth to me in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to his courage,\Nour plan may yet succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And although Lord Yasui has been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He has shattered the enemy's hold over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.56,0:12:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith that the samurai captured\Nby Orochi will not be deterred,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but rather emboldened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.18,0:12:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They will understand why Lord Yasui lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The crescent moon symbol has\Nnot lost its meaning to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.46,0:12:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon they will be free, and I am\Ncertain they will join us in our battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,On the night of the fire festival,\Nwe will go forth and raid Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:13:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We have not been defeated in the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.66,0:13:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,if we hope to see this through to the\Nend, to the death of Kaido and Orochi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.90,0:13:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.02,0:13:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you please fight\Nbeside us once more, Ashura?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.84,0:13:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something important\NI think you need to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.94,0:13:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My sweet red bean soap!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.86,0:13:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Aline, you're so strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.24,0:14:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And we are so dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.26,0:14:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.02,0:14:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We are under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The front gate has been\Ncompletely destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.24,0:14:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever did that has a death wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.38,0:14:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone go kick their ass! Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not taking another stab!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.52,0:14:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Face sounds quite powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The intruder has successfully\Nbroken through the second gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.76,0:14:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They're now approaching the third gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.84,0:14:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The third gate is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.90,0:14:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.30,0:15:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta be seeing things!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.28,0:15:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Big what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that something yummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.90,0:15:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she got knocked\Nto the bottom of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.14,0:15:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is she\Ndoing here in my prison?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.94,0:15:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of monster can\Ndestroy a steel gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.76,0:16:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She's on the same level as Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're both emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is she here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely she didn't come\Nhere to start a war!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Smells yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be close.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Red bean soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.38,0:16:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.36,0:16:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The red bean soup is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.10,0:16:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can smell it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.56,0:16:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me find some!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Olita's colony!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We can eat it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.88,0:16:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean they actually have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In here, I thought I was going to\Npay for that stupid lie with my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,More than that, she smashed\Nthrough the gate like nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I wasn't certain\Nwe could get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It was easier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.84,0:17:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okie Dock, now we just have to\Nget in there and rescue Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Momo, we have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.18,0:17:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, Luffy's counting\Non us, right? I forbid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Otama, you and Lord Momonosuke must hide\Nfrom the enemy and wait outside. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't we come too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Make no mistake, it's incredibly\Ndangerous inside of those walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the case of Lord Momonosuke, his\Nvery existence must be kept a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.52,0:17:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Right you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.28,0:17:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But Okiku, you shouldn't let them\Nknow that you're alive either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a fine point.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, I'll fashion a disguise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.76,0:17:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This should serve quite nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.49,0:17:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm concealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.86,0:17:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This has rendered me both discreet\Nand anonymous. I am ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.16,0:17:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You summoned!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.38,0:17:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I really have a lot of faith in those\Nclaw face things for some reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A brief warning first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.86,0:18:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Udon is ruled by Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He is one of the strongest members of\Nthe Beast Pirates, a lead performer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.50,0:18:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's be cautious and stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.46,0:18:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.70,0:18:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving my food to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.22,0:18:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.82,0:18:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I came a long way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.02,0:18:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.28,0:18:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard there's a whole\Nbunch of red bean soup here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.04,0:18:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't mind sharing, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't sharing a damn\Nbite with your wrinkly ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.28,0:18:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And who the hell told you I had Oshiruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.56,0:18:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to start a fight\Nmoving in on my favorite snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.12,0:19:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop arguing, or at least\Npull them out of the stupid water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.32,0:19:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here running your\Nmouth about some stupid beans,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and two people are about to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You think my soup is stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes—he's losing\Nit; we're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.98,0:19:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so angry; he's transforming—that\Nsoup is what keeps me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No one
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,can take it away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He means
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,it—he's really gonna fight\Nwith her master queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please control yourself, getting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,control yourself getting Getting into a\Nfight with Big Mom over food is suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This will not end well!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what that deafening roar\Nwas, but it didn't sound like Olene to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of them will be\Nhappy when they see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.51,0:20:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't make a second batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.52,0:20:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.22,0:20:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, we have a ton of Oshiroko\Nhere, but it belongs to me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't share a drop with you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.46,0:21:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see now
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.20,0:21:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Polina's still pretty scary, but\Nshe's like a nice version of Big Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.58,0:21:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't know if she can\Nstand up to Queen or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.06,0:21:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost worried about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.44,0:21:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So what I'm hearing is that\Nyou've got Oshiruko, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.96,0:21:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fight you to the death before\NI even let you look at my Oshiruko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now buzz off or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.72,0:21:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.18,0:21:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.66,0:22:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.64,0:22:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I came for that soup, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.66,0:22:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.20,0:22:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Olene!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.56,0:22:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the queen know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.96,0:22:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,CastingWords
